NOTICE

pyanypia is a Python port derived from the C++ source code of the Social
Security Administration's Detailed Calculator (AnyPIA), published by SSA's
Office of the Chief Actuary. That source code is a work of the United States
Government and is in the public domain (17 U.S.C. § 105). A pristine copy of
the C++ source used for this port is vendored under oracle/vendor/ in the
source repository.

pyanypia is NOT an official Social Security Administration product and is not
endorsed by SSA. Benefit amounts it computes are estimates for research
purposes; do not rely on them for benefit decisions. Consult SSA for official
benefit determinations.
